 # Local AI Workspace for Android
 
 An Android-first, offline-by-default AI workspace with a runtime-neutral Model Manager. The app keeps projects, chats, imported documents, local retrieval evidence, memory and model metadata in an on-device Room database. Model binaries stay in app-private storage; they are never stored in Room.
+
+Version **0.1.9** retains an unchanged healthy LiteRT CPU engine across chats/projects and creates a clean conversation for each new chat owner. Navigation no longer unconditionally unloads model weights. Idle engines expire after 10 minutes or reported idle memory pressure; Android may reclaim them earlier. Initial cold loading, changed configurations and CPU decoding still take time. GGUF retains its existing safe unload path. Chat deletion, private storage and Room schema2 remain. [Implementation and exact phone checks](docs/WARM_MODEL_019.md).
+
+Validation:114 app tests executed/PASS,2 unchanged compatibility tests up to date; debug assembly PASS; lint0errors/73existing warnings. New physical warm-navigation/performance validation is **NOT_EXECUTED**. Release and delivery are recorded in [the 0.1.9 manifest](docs/validation/apk-019.json). Prior semantic relevance failure remains unresolved.
+
+**APK / DRIVE PASS**: [Download signed 0.1.9 ARM64 APK](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uog6Eiy_sH97ThrnN6k681EmvtKfy9UE/view?usp=drivesdk), 91,420,601 bytes, versionCode10, same update certificate. Local file `dist/apk/local-ai-workspace-0.1.9-warm-model-arm64.apk`, SHA-256 `b21c059ba92c65d4de426bd1b8c78f462acf484bd186116e17f822aaea21095d`. Release assembly PASS in3m4s; signature/package/version/DEX markers and all8 native SHA comparisons with0.1.8 PASS. Drive readback confirms exact filename/size/MIME/parent/private sharing; provider checksum unavailable. The0.1.8 APK remains intact locally and in Drive. Install as an update without clearing app data.
+
+## Previous release — 0.1.8
 
 Version **0.1.8** adds **⋮ → Delete chat** in Workspace project cards and the chat toolbar, with confirmation. It deletes conversation records/messages/citations/tool history transactionally while keeping the project, files, memory and models. Open-chat deletion stops generation and unloads native session state before returning to Workspace. Reopening starts an empty chat. Room stays schema 2; install as an update without clearing app data. [Behavior and phone checks](docs/CHAT_DELETION_018.md).
 
